0d7d677-f196-4687-a54f-ea50dbe147b4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8865b165-1e3a-4754-a7e9-66aa4f4224a2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d70acdb6-67ba-4799-8128-9517ea788921\">​게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-af61c9bf-e0d3-4fb8-8d84-ff99a5b02591\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-98affcf1-b78a-4daf-b0b9-91b1e64a5ccc\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dd61b94b-753e-4928-bce1-f8123ff536b6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-52ec39cf-8dcb-4fce-9e35-4497e79d39e3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed3dcdc8-bcaa-44c0-9eb9-a1a9fb6d0d58\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4ef088a0-3416-47d0-9a6f-334bf8c3797b\">​​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b997041c-c117-420e-94ce-121e50e335e8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-676bc765-e376-4787-adf5-2e8315fc8fe6\"><b>📢 11/11(화) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a4791296-481e-4f2d-8f9c-eb36e28a2d4b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e19eb92a-812c-49a5-937a-ee4fb789f694\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \"