\"\" id=\"SE-d9151534-678a-47bd-8030-42bdd9b2858b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ce7e3eb1-16f6-450d-9db2-ee679cdbb24f\">3. 일부 계정에서 미니 게임 REBUILD : EDEN의 시설물 건설 관련 업적을 달성할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bf53e145-d750-438f-94d1-bd2b75a9b20e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9b8482ba-abde-4675-8fa0-b54f12874fa2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ce889d17-9a5e-458b-9db6-ca6b50a46f79\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8a20749d-6cc2-46fa-bc65-154160ea5acb\">​​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0182f60-bdee-4dd6-978b-fc7bef485e81\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-856cee14-a1ee-4197-9f48-de6613770df9\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70112ec6-8df6-4854-8e76-867f474e6108\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b2e587e4-b444-4da6-bd3e-12333224a2d5\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-65289501-9114-4fda-892d-d9b0ece2ba0e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6d9dc9c9-b603-4da0-9670-f9b35ed97e6f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b9662e26-b8da-4d44-89b5-106434e86b25\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=